## Location of the Android SDK
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YourUsername\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

## NUX Backend Server URL (Optional: Leave empty for standalone/offline build)
# nux.server.url=https://your-custom-backend.com

## OpenRouter / Gemini AI API Key (Optional: for AI Crash Diagnostics fallback)
# nux.ai.api.key=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
